quran[17]{c,v,t}:
  103,1,By Time!*
  103,2,"Indeed, humans are in (great) loss (for he is losing the most valuable commodity of his life),"
  103,3,"except those who believe, perform righteous deeds, urge one another to truth and urge one another to patience."
  104,1,"Woe to every backbiter (and) slanderer,"
  104,2,"who gathers wealth (greedily) and counts it repeatedly,"
  104,3,thinking that his wealth will make him live forever.
  104,4,"No, indeed! He will be thrown into the Crushing Fire."
  104,5,What will make you realise what the Crushing Fire is?
  104,6,"(It is) Allah’s Fire made to blaze,"
  104,7,which will overspread the hearts.
  104,8,"Indeed, it will be enclosed upon them,"
  104,9,with towering columns extended (such that they will not find any means to escape).
  105,1,Have you not seen how your Lord dealt with the People of the Elephant?
  105,2,"Did He not cause their scheme to end in confusion,"
  105,3,"and sent upon them flocks of birds,"
  105,4,"pelting them with stones of baked clay,"
  105,5,and made them (perish) like the straw chewed up?
